abstract: >-
  The Human Function World Model (HFWM) is a whole-person world-model framework
  organized through human function across internal and external tasks, demand,
  human-function capacity, actual functional engagement, evidence, governed action,
  feedback, and longitudinal change. UOHF provides the semantic foundation.
